-    $$ \cos \theta = \frac{1}{2g} \left( 1 + g^2 - \left( \frac{1 - g^2}{1 - g + 2g u_1} \right)^2 \right) $$
-    If $g=0$, set $\cos \theta = 1 - 2u_1$ [S1, unofficial].
